  "details": "Since 2025.1.2, build 1585 cloth components are breaking whenever the avatar gets reloaded.\n\nFor example, when you calibrate full body, turn locomotion animations off/on.\n\nIf you switch avatar to another and then back it breaks too but if you wait a couple minutes and then switch back it doesnt break/works again.\n\nWhen it breaks, physics dont work anymore and/or the whole mesh size changes or disappears completely. The issue is visible for you and other players.\n\nIf you rejoin a world, your cloth component only breaks for other players but not for yourself. But if you leave the world and wait a couple minutes before joining the same instance again it's not broken for others.\n\nI know not many use cloth component but it's very annoying for me because it messes up my skirt.\n\nEdit:\n\nthis only seems to happen if the mesh with the cloth component has blendshapes",
